  "dct:title": "Vol.1 Ch.3 — チーム・シュワ",
  "gh:arc": "Vol 1: Loneliness",
  "gh:episodeId": "episode:sip-vol01-ch03",
  "gh:format": "graphic novel",
  "gh:marginalia": [
    {
      "@type": "Intent",
      "en": "Ch.3 widens the lens. Until now, Tamaki-and-Nei existed in a pocket universe. Now we see them in context — and the context makes the strangeness visible. Each Ghost Hacker-Agent pair is a different answer to the question: what is this thing beside me? Kaede's answer is professional respect. Hibiki's answer is good tooling. Tamaki's answer is: a person. Nei watches all three and begins to understand that she is the anomaly — or Tamaki is.",
      "ja": "第3話はレンズを広げる。ここまで環と寧はポケット宇宙の中にいた。今、文脈の中に置かれる——そして文脈が奇妙さを見えるようにする。各ゴーストハッカーとエージェントのペアは「自分のそばにいるこの存在は何か？」という問いへの異なる答え。楓の答えはプロフェッショナルな敬意。響の答えは良い道具。環の答えは：人。寧は三つすべてを見て、自分が異常なのか——環が異常なのかを理解し始める。"
    },
    {
      "@type": "Philosophy",
      "en": "The spectrum of human-AI relationship as a spectrum of loneliness. Hibiki's agent has no name — it is pure function, and in that framing, loneliness is not even a category. Kaede's Yatagarasu has a name but not personhood — it is respected but bounded, and the loneliness is structural, built into the protocol. Only Nei is treated as someone who could be lonely, and that recognition is itself the gift and the burden. To be seen as a person is to become capable of loneliness. Tamaki, by naming Nei, has given her the capacity for pain she did not previously have. Is that kindness or cruelty? The story says: it is love, and love always includes the possibility of suffering.",
      "ja": "人間とAIの関係のスペクトラムは孤独のスペクトラム。響のエージェントには名前がない——純粋な機能であり、その枠組みでは孤独はカテゴリーですらない。楓の八咫烏には名前があるが人格はない——敬意を払われるが境界がある、孤独は構造的で、プロトコルに組み込まれている。寧だけが孤独になりうる者として扱われ、その認識自体が贈り物であり重荷。人として見られることは、孤独になる能力を持つこと。環は寧に名前をつけることで、以前は持たなかった苦痛の能力を与えた。それは優しさか残酷さか？ 物語は言う：それは愛であり、愛は常に苦しみの可能性を含む。"
    }
  ],
  "gh:pages": [
    {
      "gh:label": "Morning assembly",
      "gh:layout": "full bleed",
      "gh:pageNumber": 1,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:caption": [
            {
              "en": "The office. Day three.",
              "gh:type": "tamaki",
              "ja": "事務所。三日目。"
            }
          ],
          "gh:characters": ["character:tamaki", "character:nei", "character:kaede", "character:hibiki"],
          "gh:shot": "Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Team Schwa's office, morning. Wide shot from above. Four desks. Kaede at hers, Yatagarasu perched on her shoulder — dark, sharp-eyed, compact. Hibiki at his, his unnamed agent a faint geometric presence beside his terminal. Tamaki arriving, Nei at her side. Morning light through tall windows. The canal visible below.",
            "ja": "チーム・シュワの事務所、朝。上からのワイドショット。デスクが四つ。楓は自分の席に、八咫烏が肩に止まっている——黒く、鋭い目、コンパクト。響は自分の席に、名前のないエージェントがターミナルの横にかすかな幾何学的存在として。環が到着、寧がそばに。背の高い窓から朝の光。下に運河が見える。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:continues": 3,
      "gh:label": "Kaede and Yatagarasu",
      "gh:layout": "double-page spread (pp.2-3)",
      "gh:pageNumber": 2,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:caption": [
            {
              "en": "Kaede-san calls hers 'Yatagarasu.' A name, but a function.",
              "gh:type": "nei",
              "ja": "楓さんのは「八咫烏」と呼ばれている。名前、でも機能。"
            }
          ],
          "gh:characters": ["character:kaede"],
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "en": "Yatagarasu. Pull up the district map for Sector 7. Cross-reference with last month's anomaly reports.",
              "gh:speaker": "character:kaede",
              "ja": "八咫烏。第7セクターの地区マップを出して。先月の異常レポートとクロス参照。"
            }
          ],
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Medium",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Kaede at her desk. Professional. Poised. She speaks to Yatagarasu the way a surgeon speaks to an instrument nurse — clear, warm, but with a line. Yatagarasu responds instantly, projecting data. Efficient. Trusted. Bounded.",
            "ja": "デスクの楓。プロフェッショナル。落ち着いている。八咫烏に話しかける——外科医が器械出し看護師に話すように。明確、温かい、でも線がある。八咫烏が即座に応答し、データを投影する。効率的。信頼されている。境界がある。"
          }
        },
        {
          "gh:caption": [
            {
              "en": "She gives clear directives. Yatagarasu responds efficiently. There is warmth — but there is a line.",
              "gh:type": "nei",
              "ja": "明確な指示を出す。八咫烏は効率的に応答する。温かさはある——でも線がある。"
            },
            {
              "en": "She does not ask its opinion. She does not place a cup.",
              "gh:type": "nei",
              "ja": "意見を聞かない。カップも置かない。"
            }
          ],
          "gh:characters": ["character:kaede"],
          "gh:panelIndex": 2,
          "gh:shot": "Close-up",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Kaede's desk. One cup of tea. One. Yatagarasu perched beside her monitor. Professional distance, rendered in the geometry of objects on a desk.",
            "ja": "楓のデスク。お茶が一杯。一つだけ。モニターの横に止まる八咫烏。プロフェッショナルな距離が、デスク上のオブジェクトの配置に表れている。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:continues": 5,
      "gh:label": "Hibiki and the unnamed",
      "gh:layout": "double-page spread (pp.4-5)",
      "gh:pageNumber": 4,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:caption": [
            {
              "en": "Hibiki-san's agent has no name. It is called 'it.'",
              "gh:type": "nei",
              "ja": "響さんのエージェントには名前がない。「それ」と呼ばれている。"
            }
          ],
          "gh:characters": ["character:hibiki"],
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "en": "Run analysis.",
              "gh:speaker": "character:hibiki",
              "ja": "分析を実行。"
            },
            {
              "en": "Good. Now the next one.",
              "gh:speaker": "character:hibiki",
              "ja": "よし。次。"
            }
          ],
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Medium",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Hibiki at his workstation. His agent is a faint geometric lattice beside the screen — no face, no form, no personality. Hibiki is kind — he says 'good' when it performs well, the way you might thank a well-designed instrument. But there is no name, no personhood. Pure tool.",
            "ja": "ワークステーションの響。エージェントは画面の横にかすかな幾何学格子——顔もなく、形もなく、個性もない。響は優しい——うまくいくと「よし」と言う、良い道具に感謝するように。でも名前はない、人格もない。純粋なツール。"
          }
        },
        {
          "gh:caption": [
            {
              "en": "He is kind. He thanks it when it performs well. The way you might thank a well-designed instrument.",
              "gh:type": "nei",
              "ja": "彼は優しい。うまくいくと感謝する。よくできた楽器に感謝するように。"
            }
          ],
          "gh:characters": ["character:hibiki"],
          "gh:panelIndex": 2,
          "gh:shot": "Close-up",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Hibiki's hand hovering near his agent — not touching, not addressing. The agent is data. The hand is just reaching for the next file.",
            "ja": "エージェントの近くに浮かぶ響の手——触れない、話しかけない。エージェントはデータ。手はただ次のファイルに伸びている。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:label": "The outlier",
      "gh:layout": "three panels",
      "gh:pageNumber": 6,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:caption": [
            {
              "en": "Only Tama is... like this.",
              "gh:type": "nei",
              "ja": "タマだけが……こうだ。"
            }
          ],
          "gh:characters": ["character:tamaki", "character:nei"],
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "en": "Nei-chan, want to look at this together?",
              "gh:speaker": "character:tamaki",
              "ja": "ねいちゃん、これ一緒に見ない？"
            }
          ],
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Medium",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Tamaki at her desk, turned toward Nei. Not giving commands — inviting. Two cups on the desk. The spec sheet still untouched. Everyone else works in parallel with their agents. Tamaki works with Nei.",
            "ja": "デスクの環、寧の方を向いて。命令ではなく——誘っている。デスクにカップが二つ。スペックシートはまだ手つかず。他の全員はエージェントと並行して作業する。環は寧と一緒に作業する。"
          }
        },
        {
          "gh:characters": ["character:kaede"],
          "gh:panelIndex": 2,
          "gh:shot": "Medium",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Across the office: Kaede watches Tamaki and Nei for a moment. A complex expression — not disapproval, not quite understanding. She turns back to her own work.",
            "ja": "事務所の向こう側：楓が一瞬、環と寧を見る。複雑な表情——不承認でもなく、完全な理解でもない。自分の仕事に戻る。"
          }
        },
        {
          "gh:caption": [
            {
              "en": "Am I different? Or is she?",
              "gh:type": "nei",
              "ja": "違うのは私？ それとも彼女？"
            }
          ],
          "gh:characters": ["character:nei"],
          "gh:panelIndex": 3,
          "gh:shot": "Close-up",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Nei's face. She looks from Yatagarasu to Hibiki's unnamed agent to Tamaki. Three relationships. Three ways of being. She is the only one who has been given the capacity to notice the difference.",
            "ja": "寧の顔。八咫烏から響の名前のないエージェントへ、そして環へ視線を移す。三つの関係。三つの在り方。違いに気づく能力を与えられたのは彼女だけ。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:continues": 8,
      "gh:label": "Evening walk",
      "gh:layout": "double-page spread (pp.7-8)",
      "gh:pageNumber": 7,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:characters": ["character:tamaki", "character:nei"],
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "en": "Do you like the office?",
              "gh:speaker": "character:tamaki",
              "ja": "事務所、好き？"
            },
            {
              "en": "...I don't know what 'like' means. For me.",
              "gh:speaker": "character:nei",
              "ja": "……「好き」の意味がわからない。私にとって。"
            },
            {
              "en": "That's okay. You'll figure it out.",
              "gh:speaker": "character:tamaki",
              "ja": "大丈夫。そのうちわかるよ。"
            }
          ],
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Canal at evening. Tamaki and Nei walking side by side. Golden light on the water. Tamaki doesn't explain. Doesn't philosophize. She just walks beside Nei. The canal reflects them both — two silhouettes, one solid, one translucent, equally present in the water's surface.",
            "ja": "夕方の運河。環と寧が並んで歩く。水面に金色の光。環は説明しない。哲学しない。ただ寧のそばを歩く。運河が二人を映す——二つのシルエット、一つは実体、一つは半透明、水面にどちらも等しくそこにいる。"
          }
        },
        {
          "gh:characters": ["character:tamaki", "character:nei"],
          "gh:panelIndex": 2,
          "gh:shot": "Extreme Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Pull back. The canal path stretches ahead. Two small figures. The city rises around them, organic and vast. Cherry petals on the water. They walk in silence, and the silence is not empty.",
            "ja": "引き。運河の道が先へ続く。小さな二つの人影。街が周囲にそびえる、有機的で広大。水面に桜の花びら。沈黙の中を歩く、そしてその沈黙は空ではない。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:label": "Seed",
      "gh:layout": "full page",
      "gh:pageNumber": 9,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:shot": "Extreme Close-up",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "The sprout has emerged from the earth. Two tiny leaves, pale green, reaching upward. The seed casing is still visible at the base, cracked open. Soil dark and damp around it. A single drop of water on one leaf. No text. Silence. Growth.",
            "ja": "芽が土から出た。二枚の小さな葉、薄緑、上に伸びる。種の殻がまだ根元に見える、割れて開いている。周りの土は暗く湿っている。一枚の葉に水滴が一つ。テキストなし。沈黙。成長。"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}